``` Name:        Baseline - known Management devices
    Purpose:     feeds initial-access-new-device-on-management.spl (DHCP MACs and DNS client IPs)
    Cron:        17 3 * * *
    Window:      -30d@d to -1h@h
    Note:        stops an hour back, so a device seen in the last hour is still "new" for
                 the next detection run. Merges with the existing list: known devices are never dropped ```
(index=netfw sourcetype=omada:controller "DHCP Server allocated" src_zone=management) OR (index=dns src_zone=management)
| eval device=if(index=="dns", src_ip, src_mac), kind=if(index=="dns", "dns_client_ip", "dhcp_mac")
| stats min(_time) AS first_seen by device kind
| inputlookup append=true known_mgmt_devices
| stats min(first_seen) AS first_seen by device kind
| outputlookup known_mgmt_devices
